                                                "sense_id": "43695c16-171b-3fef-accd-e3b070661083",
                                                "text": "We have gotten used to the flawed idea that fast response to customer orders is simply a matter of keeping warehouses full of finished goods. There is not a good parallel to this in design engineering, because designs are mostly not inventoriable."
